      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OVERLAND BOY (7) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (30.53) last time in a Grade 5 at The Meadows. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won three of six tries. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Can atone. FULL NOISE (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (24.60) in a Grade 4/5 at Traralgon. Solid record here winning three races. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Shapes as one to consider. DEVIL'S SYMPATHY (3) was an on speed winner in quick time two back then gave a start but got home into the frame when second at this track (26.43) last time. Expecting another good run. I'M FABULOUS (8) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
